codex
I found the concrete cause: Lean asks Linux for `/proc/<its-pid>/exe`, but this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` while omitting the numeric PID entry. I’m applying a local, audit-only preload shim that maps only that failing executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean source, generated artifacts, or theorem behavior. Then I’ll rerun the unchanged trusted preflight.
apply patch
